WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:05.640
Go Onizuka and Dr. Genome's 
duel is about to begin!

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.330
Good luck, Go Onizuka!

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:10.780
Defeat Genome!

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.250
He'll make a Speed Duel more fun?

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.060
He must've increased the 
Data Storm's density

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.800
to create an area where 
they can use D-Boards.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.140
Aren't you going to help him?

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.610
If he loses, Playmaker's 
identity will be revealed.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.350
Did he find out when he 
met you at the hospital?

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.320
No, that's not possible.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.460
So he said that to hook Genome?

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.980
I'm counting on you, Go.

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.760
I run Across the universe

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.930
At the speed of light

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:14.800
Begin Loading

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:18.540
Open the door of dreams

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.110
VRAINS spreads

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:25.210
Believe in myself

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:28.750
VRAINS continues

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:34.060
The circuit draws the future

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:38.130
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:39.730
Access!

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:42.430
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.030
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.330
Link with my soul

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:49.100
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.840
Now Win the Race

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.680
Connected world

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:57.180
No matter when

00:01:57.410 --> 00:02:00.550
Nothing is impossible

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:04.660
Strive for hope

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:09.260
And ride the wind!

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.900
Speed Duel!

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:35.000
I'll go first!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.140
My turn!

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:39.520
This is a nice hand.

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:42.470
I know how you duel.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.080
Oh?  Then tell me.

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:49.210
You let weak opponents appear as if they're

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:53.350
about to beat you, then you crush them.

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:56.100
That's your entertainment style.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:58.320
It's pathetic.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:00.790
You're right.

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:03.600
Huh?  That's an unexpected answer.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:06.700
Enough!  Start already!

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.370
When there are no monsters on the field...

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:14.900
...I can discard a Helixx 
to the graveyard to summon

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.410
Helixx Marmotroll without tributing!

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:20.530
He already summoned a top-class monster.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:26.090
This card takes 0 battle 
damage once per turn.

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:30.920
So even if you raise your 
monster's ATK, it's pointless.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.720
I see.

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:36.900
I end my turn.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.200
What a lame start.  Such a letdown.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.850
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.870
I summon Gouki Suprex!

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:52.690
When this card is summoned, I can 
Special Summon a Gouki from my hand!

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:55.150
I'll play this!

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:57.750
Gouki Twistcobra!

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:03.820
Then I activate Gouki Headbatt's 
effect from my hand!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:08.790
By discarding a Gouki, I can Special 
Summon it in defense position...

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:12.700
...and raise a Gouki's ATK by 800!

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:14.770
Come, Headbatt!

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:24.480
Suprex's ATK increases to 2600.

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:28.620
Appear!  My circuit!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:32.650
Go Onizuka is Link Summoning!

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:35.920
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Goukis!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:43.490
I set Gouki Headbatt, Twistcobra 
and Suprex in the Link Markers!

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.070
Link Summon!

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:53.180
Appear, Link 3 Gouki Thunder Ogre!

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:59.640
Equaling Great Ogre in strength, 
Thunder Ogre has appeared!

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:04.000
The three Goukis used to Link 
Summon activate their effects!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:09.350
I add three other Gouki cards 
from my deck to my hand!

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:13.380
It's proceeding exactly as I analyzed.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.880
Your analysis is pointless.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:24.760
Go is going to start fighting for real.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:29.010
The Equip Spell, Gouki Dark Mask!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.140
I equip it on Thunder Ogre!

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:47.190
When the equipped monster's effect 
activates, you take 500 damage!

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:52.160
What?  Thunder Ogre put on a creepy mask!

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:57.640
I've changed Thunder Ogre's 
name to Dark Thunder Ogre!

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.040
And!

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:05.110
I make a heel turn!

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:10.780
My name is now Dark Onizuka!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.750
Dark Onizuka?

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:17.520
Wasn't that kind of tacky?

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.490
He must've changed his fighting style.

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:24.890
Yeah.  A heel turn is a pro wrestling term.

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:26.870
Babyface into a heel.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:30.250
It means he changed into a bad guy.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:33.710
My new fighting style begins now.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:37.950
Show me Dark Onizuka's DNA.

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:40.190
You won't be so calm anymore!

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:43.460
I activate the spell card, Gouki Poison Mist!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.680
Take this!

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:52.520
That's cheating!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.560
I can't see!

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:56.160
You won't escape!

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:00.960
Due to Dark Thunder Ogre's effect, 
in addition to my usual summon...

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:04.360
...I can Special Summon a 
monster next to its link once!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:09.620
Gouki Riscorpio's effect lets 
me summon it without tributing!

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:12.980
Go, Riscorpio!

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:24.040
He destroyed his own monster 
with a hammer throw!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:28.240
He battled with Riscorpio 
even though it has lower ATK?

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.460
I'll turn this pain into power.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:36.940
Dark Thunder Ogre's effect activates!

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:42.060
When a monster next to its link is 
destroyed in battle or by an effect,

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.070
it gains 400 ATK!

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.580
So that was his plan!

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:54.450
Dark Thunder Ogre and Marmotroll 
now have equal ATK.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.220
So they'll destroy each other?

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:58.790
No, there must be more to it.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:03.310
The Equip Spell Gouki Dark 
Mask's effect activates!

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:09.200
When the equipped monster's effect 
activates, you take 500 damage!

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.270
Ultimo Thunder!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:26.930
He sacrificed his teammate to 
get an advantage in the duel.

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:29.450
That's how a heel battles.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:34.020
Riscorpio went to the graveyard, 
so its effect activates.

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:37.700
I add a Gouki card from my deck to my hand.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:45.800
If this is your evolution, 
I'll gladly take your DNA.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:48.270
My DNA?

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:51.060
I'm a DNA researcher.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:54.280
I want the DNA of powerful duelists.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:57.250
I'll take Playmaker's DNA next!

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.570
What will you do with that?

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:04.770
I'll combine and evolve them 
into more powerful DNA.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.760
You're weird.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:10.230
I activate my Skill, Fighting Spirit!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:16.680
Go Onizuka- I mean Dark Onizuka- 
activates his Skill, Fighting Spirit!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:23.260
Once per duel, I can Special Summon a Gouki 
that was destroyed in battle this turn!

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:27.310
Go again, Riscorpio!

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:29.960
Attack Marmotroll!

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:42.130
He threw his teammate again.

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:45.930
That means Dark Thunder Ogre will power up.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:50.370
And if its effect activates, 
Genome will take damage.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.370
Dark Thunder Ogre's effect activates.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:56.340
It gains 400 ATK again!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.080
And!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:01.010
Ultimo Thunder!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.890
You can't hide from me!

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:19.620
Dark Thunder Ogre, crush Marmotroll!

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:25.800
There you are!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:38.280
All right!  He can take away Genome's LP!

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.630
Actually...

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:40.750
Yeah...

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:47.960
Due to Marmotroll's effect, 
I take 0 battle damage.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.160
I took that into consideration.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:57.640
Your heel fighting style is quite fun!

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:02.160
I've evolved into Dark Onizuka!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:14.720
You evolved because you 
lost against Playmaker?

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:17.020
Frustrating, but true.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:19.460
That's when everything changed.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:26.800
The children in the orphanage 
idolized me again after that battle.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:34.380
Playmaker has changed this generation.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:40.800
Vowing to defeat Playmaker, 
I thoroughly studied him.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:47.400
And I learned that my 
style was last generation.

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.250
However...

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:52.420
My dueling is to entertain people!

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.680
That's one thing I won't change!

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:55.960
That's right.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:12:00.510
The crowd adores power 
and are drawn to victory.

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:06.300
So I think they'll accept you 
adopting a different fighting style.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.900
A different fighting style?

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.810
And I made up my mind!

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:19.850
I'll adopt a dark fighting 
style and do anything to win!

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:23.960
The crowd yearns for overwhelming power!

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:26.320
That is my entertainment!

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:31.100
Nice, Dark Onizuka!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:32.700
You're the best!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.500
I'll keep cheering for you!

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:39.810
So that meathead just started 
using a bit of his brain.

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:45.240
He's trying to take a new 
step forward in his own way.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.250
I hear that story a lot.

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:51.910
When the strong loses, they start to worry.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.860
But that means nothing.

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:58.690
The only important thing is whether 
you have excellent DNA or not.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:03.580
Even if you become a heel, 
your DNA hasn't changed.

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:08.670
Your destiny, your duel, 
everything is predetermined!

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:09.980
Stop joking!

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:13.410
I'll decide my destiny and my duel!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:17.370
I'll show you the limits to your DNA.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:20.610
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:27.320
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Graveyard Incubation!

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.670
I Special Summon two Marmotrolls

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:34.030
from my graveyard by negating 
their effects and dropping

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:36.910
their ATK and DEF to 0!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.870
Here it comes!

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:47.310
Appear!  Our future circuit!

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:50.430
The summoning conditions are two Helixxes!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:53.410
I set two Marmotrolls!

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:58.550
Link Summon!

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:03.520
You're up, Helixx Gothiclone!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:10.230
Link 2 Gothiclone has appeared!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:16.710
When there's a Link Monster, I can 
summon Dreadrat without tributing!

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:19.680
I set a card.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:23.780
Gothiclone, attack Dark Thunder Ogre!

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:27.610
Dark Thunder Ogre is stronger.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:29.940
Why is he attacking?

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.350
He must have a plan.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.540
I'll take the fight!

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.270
Go, Dark Thunder Ogre!

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:43.410
Gothiclone's ATK becomes the same 
as the monster it's battling.

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:46.050
They'll both be destroyed.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:50.230
Gothiclone's effect is only beginning.

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:54.370
This card can't be destroyed 
in battle once per turn!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.340
Same with mine!

00:14:56.340 --> 00:15:01.480
Dark Thunder Ogre can't be destroyed in 
battle or by an effect once per turn!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:11.470
Whoa!  A double KO!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:19.160
This also happened in your 
duel against Playmaker.

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:30.300
Your appearance may have changed, 
but your DNA hasn't evolved.

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:34.010
Gothiclone has another effect!

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.280
What?

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:38.820
Since it used its effect 
to avoid destruction...

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:45.010
...I can tribute a linked monster 
to deal you damage equal to its ATK.

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:49.160
I tribute Dreadrat!

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:57.890
I end my turn.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:02.720
Gothiclone's effect ends, so 
its ATK returns to normal.

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:05.310
My turn...

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:07.600
I draw.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:14.820
You said that DNA predetermines 
a person's destiny and his duel.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:17.460
But those are your limits!

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:19.320
I'll show you your limits!

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.060
Interesting.

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:25.030
I summon Riscorpio without tributing!

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:33.740
Due to Dark Thunder Ogre's effect, 
I summon a Gouki next to its link!

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:36.840
Appear, Gouki Twistcobra!

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:42.980
By tributing Riscorpio, Gouki 
Twistcobra's effect activates!

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:49.220
A Gouki monster gains ATK 
equal to the tributed monster!

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:56.510
Dark Thunder Ogre gains Riscorpio's 
2300 ATK, rising to 5300.

00:16:58.640 --> 00:17:00.520
I'll end this.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.170
Riscorpio's effect activates!

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:06.420
I add a Gouki card from my deck to my hand!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:10.410
From my hand, I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Gouki Serpent Splash!

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:15.030
You take damage equal to the 
difference in Dark Thunder Ogre's

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.150
current and original ATK!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.120
That means...

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.340
Whoa!  3100 damage!

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.860
Genome has 2300 LP.

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:29.830
Onizuka wins.

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.940
This is the finish!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:34.740
Go, Dark Thunder Ogre!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.330
You think you've won?

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:41.710
I can't afford to take that damage.

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:45.040
This is the limit to your DNA!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.780
What are you going to do?

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:50.020
I activate the trap, Regeneration Cure!

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:53.490
Effect damage becomes 0!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.920
He blocked Serpent Splash's damage!

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:06.250
He could've used Regeneration 
Cure against Dark Mask's effect.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:08.630
But he deliberately withheld it.

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:14.400
Due to Regeneration Cure's additional 
effect, I Special Summon a Helixx Token!

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:18.560
I end my turn.

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:24.620
Dark Thunder Ogre's ATK 
drops from 5300 to 3000.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.020
Their LP are about equal, but...

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:31.090
It feels like Genome has Onizuka 
in the palm of his hand.

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:34.090
My turn.  I draw.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:39.030
I activate Dreadrat's effect from 
the graveyard to Special Summon it!

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:49.240
Appear!  Our future circuit!

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:53.920
The summoning conditions are two Helixxes!

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:57.680
I set Helixx Token and Dreadrat!

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:01.490
You're finally up!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.790
Link Summon!

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:06.810
The strongest DNA combines into this monster!

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:14.330
Link 2 Helixx Necro Darwin!

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:22.170
When Necro Darwin is mutually 
linked, it can't be attacked.

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.640
What?

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:27.620
And when Dreadrat is Special 
Summoned by its own effect...

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:30.740
...it's banished when it leaves the field.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:35.220
Since I know the limits of DNA,

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:41.130
I can combine superior DNA 
to create an evolved monster.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:45.360
Necro Darwin, attack Twistcobra!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:55.680
Since Gouki Twistcobra was sent to 
the graveyard, its effect activates!

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:58.610
I add a Gouki card from my deck to my hand!

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:05.900
Since Twistcobra was destroyed, Dark 
Thunder Ogre's effect activates!

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:08.090
It gains 400 ATK!

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:11.820
And the Equip Spell Gouki Dark Mask's effect!

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:14.280
Ultimo Thunder!

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:19.270
Necro Darwin's effect activates!

00:20:19.270 --> 00:20:21.900
Effect damage becomes 0!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:27.170
And its ATK doubles until 
the end of the turn!

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:32.640
Necro Darwin's ATK rises to 3600!

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:37.380
Gothiclone, attack Dark Thunder Ogre!

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:42.570
Gothiclone's ATK becomes the same 
as the monster it's battling.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:47.860
And once per turn, this card 
can't be destroyed in battle!

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:52.830
